              "url": "https://web.physics.ucsb.edu/~mark/ms-qft-DRAFT.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "physical_scope": "A conditional compact-variation Dirac equation and formal minimal magnetic coefficient for a smooth static pure magnetic background. The result is the minimal/tree Pauli coefficient only: it proves no self-adjoint magnetic closure, full spectrum, Landau-level construction, radiative correction, or empirical equality.",
