              "title": "Mark Srednicki, Quantum Field Theory, author-hosted prepublication draft, §§11 and 46–48",
              "url": "https://web.physics.ucsb.edu/~mark/ms-qft-DRAFT.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        "physical_scope": "A massless specialization of the adopted formal one-photon tree coefficient. It compares two angular coefficients and integrates their formal coefficient over the sphere; it is not a measured event ratio or exact continuum QED cross section.",
        "empirical_premises": [],
        "dependency_level": 9
      },
